Z||000000||zeusrekning||06-16-99||06:37 PM||||Does anyone know how much the notch back tail lights are and how easily the install.
Z||000001||PaUL||06-16-99||06:44 PM||||I dont know how much they are but I can tell you that they are very easy to remove and install. Under the rear decklid, right above the taillights, theres these small black plastic caps. Remove these then simply unscrew the screws found underneath. The lights should then come out. 
